# Per-brand visual assets (icon/splash/adaptive icons) arrive with the manifest.
# Tracked brandovi (airkuna) se NE ignoriraju; privatni brandovi dobivaju
# eksplicitnu liniju ispod. NIKAD ne koristiti blanket /brand/assets/* + !-iznimku:
# EAS arhiver (npm ignore lib) ne poštuje re-include ispod isključenog direktorija
# pa build tiho ostane bez asseta (Prebuild ENOENT — build 2c43e4a3).
# /brand/assets/<privatni-brand>/ linije dodavati po potrebi:

# expo-updates code-signing PRIVATE keys — must never be committed.
# (The public certificate under brand/certs/ is safe to track.)
/keys/


